From 7dce90bc6b467fe7d2a80812f9ce205dab8a8291 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 22:22:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Recipe types for WASM server mods (API block 6)

Capability recipe-types: recipes of types outside minecraft as their files
say, and the items an ingredient names (tags resolved by the game,
RecipeData tested). SDK re-exports serde_json; recipe-crusher example and
harness support ([[recipe]], [tags], items). API level 9.
